:: flag.restless [flag]

(metadata:
"id", [Restlessness],
"type", (a: "att"),
"desc", [Frustrated energy. Hurts to have, hurts to let go. May motivate you to push through with certain tasks, but it will hurt.],
"tip", [Each decreases your ''Mind'' by 1, which is now ''(print: $player's mind)''.],
"gainText", [You become restless, and though your mind suffers for it, it is nonetheless vital energy.],
"lossText", [You put your frustrated energy to work. You feel better.],
"gainEffect", (macro: num-type _value, [(out:)[(set: $player's mind to it - _value)(rerun: ?sidebarMind)]]),
"lossEffect", (macro: num-type _value, [(out:)[(set: $player's mind to it - _value)(rerun: ?sidebarMind)]]),
)